<p>People has the <span class="mathjax-latex">\\(\\text{/i:/}\\)</span> sound. Quay also has the <span class="mathjax-latex">\\(/i:/ \\)</span>sound which makes it the correct answer. Shone has the /\u0259/ sound while option D has the (a) sound</p>
